{"c":[{"name":"20261007T103113Z-2eca6bf2c96e40c9","text":"Ask evals: realfill-asks --spend-limit 0 refuses replayed requests too; for a $0 replay set CARET_JEV_CACHE_MODE=replay, unset CARET_ENV_FILE and pass a nonzero --spend-limit (misses fail as jevFailed).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261007T113449Z-ded1f2a70adbf732","text":"fill dates: any resolver assumption (year from a reference, order from a format/locale, century) sends the value to the verifier with Provenance.says; send-line years and stated-format orders are offered as their own candidates; a raw span never takes them.","type":"note"}]}
